  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine, BD 909 Clean Short C 04 (TR-909 From Mars): Decay short, Tune at mid. A 25-semitone sweep (about 195 Hz at 5 ms, 150 Hz at 10 ms) down to 49 Hz on C4, the recording's settled pitch; the body holds 56 ms, then cuts off. A biased drive makes the body lopsided, its negative half-cycles taller, and a zero-attack square edge opens it on a negative step. The general-purpose short kick.",
